  "'Uncoater Base' gives free levels to 'Symptom Base' and autobuy buyables once per second.":"'脱壳者基础' 每秒为 '症状基础' 提供免费等级并自动购买可购买项一次。",
  "'UnExper' divides 'UnPower Exponent' scaling, 'Disease Boost' base+0.0025, UI gain exp+1.":"'UnExper' 降低 'UnPower Exponent' 缩放，'疾病增益' 基础+0.0025，未接种传染性 产出指数+1。",
  "'Unfolded Protein Exp' boosts its base, unc enz and 'BasExp' effs are exponents.":"'Unfolded Protein Exp' 增益其基础，unc enz 和 'BasExp' 效果为指数。",
  "'UnLog' base+0.001, Self-Unquarantine slog+0.04, unlock a row of Main upgrades.":"'UnLog' 基础+0.001，Self-Unquarantine slog+0.04，解锁一行 Main 升级。",
  "'UnLog' base+0.001, Self-Unquarantine slog+0.04.":"'UnLog'基础+0.001，自我解除隔离slog+0.04。",
  "'UnPowerer' divides 'UnPower Gain' scaling, 'Disease Boost' base+0.0025, UI gain exp+0.5.":"'UnPowerer' 降低 'UnPower Gain' 缩放，'疾病增益' 基础+0.0025，未接种传染性 产出指数+0.5。",
